ing in any business leadership role requires you to think critically, and make quality decisions, even in the face of challenges such as imperfect/incomplete information, changing and unforeseen circumstances, and human nature in all of its complexity and unpredictability. Major content themes of this course focus on constructing a persuasive argument and deconstructing arguments made by others; recognizing and avoiding reasoning flaws and the forces that make us most susceptible to such flaws; approaching business problems systematically and thoroughly; and producing a problem solution that is (a) well-reasoned; (b) likely to be well-received by ultimate decision makers; and (c) able to be implemented successfully.", "catalogBreadth": "", "catalogDistr": "", "catalogEnrollmentPriority": null, "catalogLang": "", "catalogForbiddenOverlaps": "", "catalogAttribute": "", "catalogWhenOffered": "Summer.", "catalogComments": "", "catalogPrereqCoreq": "", "catalogPrereq": null, "catalogCoreq": null, "catalogFee": "", "catalogSatisfiesReq": "", "catalogPermission": "", "catalogCourseSubfield": "", "catalogOutcomes": null, "acadCareer": "GM", "acadGroup": "BU", "lastTermsOffered": null, "exploreCriteriaIds": []}, {"strm": 2874, "crseId": 366661, "crseOfferNbr": 1, "subject": "NCCY", "catalogNbr": "5060", "titleShort": "Managerial Finance", "titleLong": "Managerial Finance", "crseAttrs": [], "crseAttrValueGroups": [], "enrollGroups": [{"classSections": [{"ssrComponent": "LEC", "ssrComponentLong": "Lecture", "section": "001", "classNbr": 1543, "meetings": [{"classMtgNbr": 1, "timeStart": "09:00AM", "timeEnd": "11:45AM", "startDt": "07/29/2024", "endDt": "08/09/2024", "instructors": [{"instrAssignSeq": 1, "netid": "kep88", "firstName": "Kelly", "middleName": "", "lastName": "Posenau"}], "pattern": "MTRF", "facilityDescr": "Tata Innovation Center 123", "bldgDescr": "Tata Innovation Center", "facilityDescrshort": "TIC123", "meetingTopicDescription": ""}, {"classMtgNbr": 2, "timeSt